# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# The noindex block below keeps the staging deployment out of search results
# while the site runs on *.pages.dev without a domain. It MUST be removed on
# launch day: it is item "noindex ו-Discourage search engines הוסרו מהאתר החי"
# in the GO LIVE GATE, and it is listed in ROADMAP.md.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

# Security headers that are safe on any host. HSTS is deliberately left out
# until the real domain is attached, because *.pages.dev is a shared hostname.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
